  "faq": {
    "section_html": "<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col items-center\" data-v-00432764=\"\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><h2 data-seo-reveal-stage=\"title\" class=\"text-[2.25rem] leading-[2.625rem] home-faq-title mb-[1.875rem] text-center font-bold text-c-primary-text md:mb-[2.5rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><span data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Frequently Asked </span><span class=\"home-faq-title-emphasis\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Questions</span></h2><p class=\"home-body-regular mt-[1.5rem] max-w-[57.5rem] text-center text-pmd-normal-content text-c-secondary-text md:text-[1.5rem] md:leading-[1.875rem] md:text-c-normal-content\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Explore the most common questions about Pokecut's free features, usage, account access, and AI editing tools.</p><!----><div class=\"mt-[1.875rem] flex w-full flex-col gap-[0.75rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><!--[--><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div class=\"w-full home-faq-mobile-collapse overflow-hidden rounded-[0.9375rem] bg-c-bg-light-gray w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div id=\"0\" class=\"px-[1.875rem] pk-collapse-header flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"--icon-size:1.875rem;--accordion-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_open.svg);--active-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_close.svg);\"><!--[--><div class=\"flex min-h-[5.625rem] min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-[1.875rem] pr-[2.25rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><h3 class=\"text-left text-[1.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.875rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">What is Pokecut and what can I use it for?</h3></div><!--]--></div><div class=\"pk-collapse-panel\"><!--[--><div class=\"px-[1.875rem] pb-[1.875rem] text-[1.125rem] leading-[1.5rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><p data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Pokecut is an all-in-one AI photo editing platform designed for portraits, travel photos, product images, and creative content. You can remove backgrounds, erase objects, enhance quality, create collages, and customise images with stickers, text, and templates, all in one place. With Pokecut's AI image generation, you can also turn prompts into studio-grade portraits, artistic visuals, Christmas scenes, fantasy maps, marketing banners, and more in seconds.</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div class=\"w-full home-faq-mobile-collapse overflow-hidden rounded-[0.9375rem] bg-c-bg-light-gray w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div id=\"1\" class=\"px-[1.875rem] pk-collapse-header flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"--icon-size:1.875rem;--accordion-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_open.svg);--active-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_close.svg);\"><!--[--><div class=\"flex min-h-[5.625rem] min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-[1.875rem] pr-[2.25rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><h3 class=\"text-left text-[1.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.875rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">How do I use Pokecut?</h3></div><!--]--></div><div class=\"pk-collapse-panel\"><!--[--><div class=\"px-[1.875rem] pb-[1.875rem] text-[1.125rem] leading-[1.5rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><p data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">You can start by uploading a photo, choosing an AI tool, or typing a prompt in the AI generator. Pokecut will guide you into the editor, where you can preview the result, adjust the edit, and export your final image.</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div class=\"w-full home-faq-mobile-collapse overflow-hidden rounded-[0.9375rem] bg-c-bg-light-gray w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div id=\"2\" class=\"px-[1.875rem] pk-collapse-header flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"--icon-size:1.875rem;--accordion-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_open.svg);--active-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_close.svg);\"><!--[--><div class=\"flex min-h-[5.625rem] min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-[1.875rem] pr-[2.25rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><h3 class=\"text-left text-[1.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.875rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Is Pokecut free?</h3></div><!--]--></div><div class=\"pk-collapse-panel\"><!--[--><div class=\"px-[1.875rem] pb-[1.875rem] text-[1.125rem] leading-[1.5rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><p data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Yes, Pokecut is free to use. You can receive free credits to try out basic features, such as photo enhancement and background removal. However, usage is limited. To unlock more edits, higher resolution, and full feature access, you can go to the <a class=\"custom-a-d\" href=\"/pricing\">online store</a> to subscribe to the Pro plan.</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div class=\"w-full home-faq-mobile-collapse overflow-hidden rounded-[0.9375rem] bg-c-bg-light-gray w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div id=\"3\" class=\"px-[1.875rem] pk-collapse-header flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"--icon-size:1.875rem;--accordion-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_open.svg);--active-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_close.svg);\"><!--[--><div class=\"flex min-h-[5.625rem] min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-[1.875rem] pr-[2.25rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><h3 class=\"text-left text-[1.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.875rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Can I use Pokecut without signing up?</h3></div><!--]--></div><div class=\"pk-collapse-panel\"><!--[--><div class=\"px-[1.875rem] pb-[1.875rem] text-[1.125rem] leading-[1.5rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><p data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Yes you can. Pokecut can be used directly without signing up or login.</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div class=\"w-full home-faq-mobile-collapse overflow-hidden rounded-[0.9375rem] bg-c-bg-light-gray w-full\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><div id=\"4\" class=\"px-[1.875rem] pk-collapse-header flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"--icon-size:1.875rem;--accordion-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_open.svg);--active-icon:url(/icons/svg/faq_icon_close.svg);\"><!--[--><div class=\"flex min-h-[5.625rem] min-w-0 flex-1 items-center py-[1.875rem] pr-[2.25rem] text-c-black\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\"><h3 class=\"text-left text-[1.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.875rem]\" data-v-dbcec2dd=\"\">Can I use Pokecut's AI photo editor for commercial use?</h3></div><!--]--></div><div class=\"pk-collapse-panel\"><!--[",
